== SoundInt ==
* SoundInt parameter defined on the component is passed to the corresponding signal, based on the character slot where the item is. * If slot is empty signal value = -1 * Coding of Weapon SoundInt example: '''1 02 01 00''' ** 1 - Weapons ** 02 - Group (Pistol, LMG) ** 01 - Type (AK74) ** 00 - Variation * Those signals then trigger extra sounds when i.e. character moves. Example: metal rattle when harness is worn
