== Administrator Roles ==

An in-game server administrator can be:
* the player hosting the server (PC only)
* a logged-in admin, using <code>#login passwordAdmin</code> (see {{Link|#login}} and {{Link|Arma Reforger:Server Config#passwordAdmin|passwordAdmin}} config)
* a voted-in admin


